906
00:33:51.180 --> 00:33:53.690
Track and field is the one area that

907
00:33:53.690 --> 00:33:55.650
when people are talking about this across the country

908
00:33:55.650 --> 00:33:59.410
they're looking at two transgender girls in Connecticut

909
00:33:59.410 --> 00:34:01.550
