00:34:09.610 --> 00:34:13.227
one didn't even compete and the other placed 30th

915
00:34:13.227 --> 00:34:15.584
and 31st in her two races.

916
00:34:15.584 --> 00:34:16.487
Okay.

917
00:34:16.487 --> 00:34:18.250
And so, yes,

918
00:34:18.250 --> 00:34:20.400
they have won races,

919
00:34:20.400 --> 00:34:23.270
but dominating is inaccurate.

920
00:34:23.270 --> 00:34:24.530
Right.

921
00:34:24.530 --> 00:34:27.020
And I think that people really pick up on those stories

922
00:34:27.020 --> 00:34:29.810
