923
00:34:29.810 --> 00:34:31.530
And I bring up race again

924
00:34:31.530 --> 00:34:34.830
because race is absolutely a part of this.

925
00:34:34.830 --> 00:34:37.290
Being a transgender woman is absolutely a part of this.

926
00:34:37.290 --> 00:34:38.210
Women in sports,

927
00:34:38.210 --> 00:34:41.890
both cisgender and trans have had their bodies policed

928
00:34:41.890 --> 00:34:44.300
