I think, that we really perpetuate

932
00:34:50.880 --> 00:34:52.943
that issue within women sports.

933
00:34:55.860 --> 00:34:57.880
What happens in track and field,

934
00:34:57.880 --> 00:34:59.880
I mean, the case study that gets brought

935
00:34:59.880 --> 00:35:01.670
up conflates intersex because it's all

936
00:35:01.670 --> 00:35:04.363
