946
00:35:28.590 --> 00:35:31.610
I can't proclaim to have the answer to that

947
00:35:31.610 --> 00:35:35.490
but it's an interesting conversation that needs to be had.

948
00:35:35.490 --> 00:35:36.340
Yeah, absolutely.

949
00:35:36.340 --> 00:35:38.400
And I think it's really important that we remember

950
00:35:38.400 --> 00:35:41.674
that there's not one way to be a man.

951
00:35:41.674 --> 00:35:43.470
There's not just one way to be a woman.

952
00:35:43.470 --> 00:35:45.810
And there are certainly categories that they have

953
00:35:45.810 --> 00:35:48.820
for hormones at the elite level of testing, right.

954
00:35:48.820 --> 00:35:50.901
But there's not just one way to be a trans person either.

