00:35:50.901 --> 00:35:53.980
And there's not just one way to have a body

956
00:35:53.980 --> 00:35:55.493
that excels in sport.

957
00:35:55.493 --> 00:35:58.780
So the body that a swimmer would have is going

958
00:35:58.780 --> 00:36:01.000
to be different than what would be helpful

959
