1010
00:38:25.770 --> 00:38:28.580
So it's important work that you're doing

1011
00:38:28.580 --> 00:38:31.570
and I wish you all the best and thank you for what you do.

1012
00:38:31.570 --> 00:38:32.470
Thank you.

1013
00:38:32.470 --> 00:38:35.440
Athletes have a platform and I think that athletes

1014
00:38:35.440 --> 00:38:37.750
