1015
00:38:37.750 --> 00:38:38.583
but in the world.

1016
00:38:38.583 --> 00:38:40.060
And we look at Olympians differently.

1017
00:38:40.060 --> 00:38:42.010
We look at professional athletes differently.

1018
00:38:42.010 --> 00:38:43.450
We even look at high school

1019
00:38:43.450 --> 00:38:45.490
and collegiate athletes differently.

1020
00:38:45.490 --> 00:38:47.960
And so I think it's an incredible position

1021
00:38:47.960 --> 00:38:50.623
for me to be in to have this platform,

1022
00:38:50.623 --> 00:38:52.530
to have a Nike sponsorship

1023
