1026
00:39:02.060 --> 00:39:03.104
not just in sport,

1027
00:39:03.104 --> 00:39:05.008
but in our community as a whole.

1028
00:39:05.008 --> 00:39:09.757
I want people to know that they can be their authentic self

1029
00:39:09.757 --> 00:39:12.190
and continue to play the sports that they love

1030
00:39:12.190 --> 00:39:14.360
and continue to do their passions and not have

1031
00:39:14.360 --> 00:39:16.670
to compromise any part of their identity,

1032
00:39:16.670 --> 00:39:18.140
to hide any part of their identity.

1033
00:39:18.140 --> 00:39:21.280
Because when we are authentic about who we are

1034
00:39:21.280 --> 00:39:23.690
and when we are able to,

1035
00:39:23.690 --> 00:39:25.910
and it's not safe for everyone to come out,

1036
00:39:25.910 --> 00:39:28.220
but if we are able to do that,

1037
00:39:28.220 --> 00:39:33.090
your entire world opens up and it not just impacts you

1038
00:39:33.090 --> 00:39:34.480
but impacts the people around you.

1039
00:39:34.480 --> 00:39:37.807
And I think that's really how social change is created,

1040
00:39:37.807 --> 00:39:39.800
is that ripple effect.

1041
00:39:39.800 --> 00:39:43.890
And so my hope is that me waking up every single day

1042
00:39:43.890 --> 00:39:47.110
and living an awesome life can be my advocacy.

1043
00:39:47.110 --> 00:39:49.960
And that all the other parts I have

1044
00:39:49.960 --> 00:39:52.320
to talk about are a part of that,

1045
00:39:52.320 --> 00:39:56.800
but I really just want people to see that I am possible,

1046
00:39:56.800 --> 00:39:59.880
that they are possible because I am possible and

1047
00:40:03.380 --> 00:40:04.480
nothing is off limits,

1048
00:40:04.480 --> 00:40:05.903
people can have a future,

1049
00:40:07.000 --> 00:40:08.908
the future that I didn't see for myself

1050
00:40:08.908 --> 00:40:11.500
when I was younger, it exists.

1051
00:40:11.500 --> 00:40:15.140
And for the person who's listening,

1052
00:40:15.140 --> 00:40:16.680
who's living

1053
00:40:17.730 --> 00:40:22.730
a secret double life or just is afraid to come out,

1054
00:40:22.840 --> 00:40:26.070
what is the kind of message that you would like

1055
00:40:26.070 --> 00:40:28.530
to impart to that person?

1056
00:40:28.530 --> 00:40:31.918
Yeah, there are so many factors that go in

1057
00:40:31.918 --> 00:40:33.480
to one's ability to come out.

1058
00:40:33.480 --> 00:40:36.670
And it's now with laws and policies like this

1059
00:40:36.670 --> 00:40:39.760
about access to care and safety.

1060
00:40:39.760 --> 00:40:42.700
There are financial concerns and family support concerns

1061
00:40:42.700 --> 00:40:43.900
for young people.

1062
00:40:43.900 --> 00:40:46.610
There are very real possibilities

1063
00:40:46.610 --> 00:40:48.750
that people will lose their house

1064
00:40:48.750 --> 00:40:51.450
or their apartment and the housing,

1065
00:40:51.450 --> 00:40:54.600
their employment and things like that.

1066
00:40:54.600 --> 00:40:56.550
And so there are so many factors that go in to it

1067
00:40:56.550 --> 00:40:59.590
that I would never tell somebody that they have to come out.

1068
00:40:59.590 --> 00:41:01.640
And I think this is one of the problems that we have

1069
00:41:01.640 --> 00:41:05.360
in professional sports is we're looking for that out gay,

1070
00:41:05.360 --> 00:41:07.453
male athlete in the big four sports.

1071
