01:37:30.490 --> 01:37:32.880
But I would like to believe at the heart of it,

2376
01:37:32.880 --> 01:37:33.813
she was just like,

2377
01:37:33.813 --> 01:37:34.646
oh my God,

2378
01:37:34.646 --> 01:37:36.340
I know a way to keep you alive.

2379
01:37:36.340 --> 01:37:40.730
I had almost died clearly because I was ingesting not

2380
01:37:40.730 --> 01:37:42.180
just animal food products

2381
01:37:42.180 --> 01:37:45.120
but far too many animal food products over the course

2382
01:37:45.120 --> 01:37:46.090
