2385
01:37:53.040 --> 01:37:54.930
and that's where she saw the opening and was, like,

2386
01:37:54.930 --> 01:37:56.440
yes, one of us,

2387
01:37:56.440 --> 01:37:57.430
one of us.

2388
01:37:57.430 --> 01:37:58.710
So I said, look,

2389
01:37:58.710 --> 01:38:01.535
I eat the way that I ate for 47 years.

2390
