2393
01:38:09.670 --> 01:38:10.540
Let me see, February,

2394
01:38:10.540 --> 01:38:11.373
March, April,

2395
01:38:11.373 --> 01:38:12.720
May, June,

2396
01:38:12.720 --> 01:38:14.495
July, it's almost two and a 1/2 years ago.

2397
01:38:14.495 --> 01:38:15.830
Two years and five months ago.

2398
01:38:15.830 --> 01:38:17.630
And I haven't missed anything.

2399
