It's just, like,

2402
01:38:22.787 --> 01:38:23.620
what do you miss, bro,

2403
01:38:23.620 --> 01:38:24.453
what do you miss?

2404
01:38:24.453 --> 01:38:25.310
Your daughter's not here.

2405
01:38:25.310 --> 01:38:26.268
What do you miss?

2406
01:38:26.268 --> 01:38:27.483
That's so shady.

2407
01:38:27.483 --> 01:38:30.730
Well, because they know that you're the decomisar

2408
01:38:30.730 --> 01:38:32.020
of all this.

2409
01:38:32.020 --> 01:38:32.853
As you said,

2410
01:38:32.853 --> 01:38:35.330
he was going vegan for life so they know now I

2411
01:38:35.330 --> 01:38:36.360
have two bosses in life,

2412
01:38:36.360 --> 01:38:37.193
not just your mother,

2413
01:38:37.193 --> 01:38:38.026
but also you.

2414
01:38:38.026 --> 01:38:38.859
Yeah, so it'll

2415
01:38:38.859 --> 01:38:40.980
have to go through me.
So when you're not around,

2416
01:38:40.980 --> 01:38:41.840
they're like, come on dude,

2417
01:38:41.840 --> 01:38:43.060
what do you really think?

2418
01:38:43.060 --> 01:38:44.850
And I honestly don't miss anything.

2419
01:38:44.850 --> 01:38:45.760
There's nothing that I'm,

2420
01:38:45.760 --> 01:38:46.612
like, oh man.

2421
01:38:46.612 --> 01:38:48.760
That's the thing that people are surprised about,

2422
01:38:48.760 --> 01:38:50.750
'cause they suspect that you're just walking

2423
01:38:50.750 --> 01:38:51.699
around craving in and out

2424
01:38:51.699 --> 01:38:53.160
all day long.
Yeah, like your whole life

2425
01:38:53.160 --> 01:38:54.950
you're like living a 1/2 or a 1/4 life

2426
01:38:54.950 --> 01:38:57.170
