Beans and rice, man,

2436
01:39:13.195 --> 01:39:17.094
tastier than most stuff that I ate on the non-vegan side.

2437
01:39:17.094 --> 01:39:19.250
That's seriously my go-to.

2438
01:39:19.250 --> 01:39:21.071
For the last month that's all I've been counting.

2439
01:39:21.071 --> 01:39:22.300
I've worked hard on beans

2440
01:39:22.300 --> 01:39:23.570
(indistinct)
The last time I saw you was

2441
