I'd be sitting next to the Joker,

2448
01:39:39.500 --> 01:39:41.700
I would've done this a long time ago.

2449
01:39:41.700 --> 01:39:42.884
A long time ago, yeah.

2450
01:39:42.884 --> 01:39:43.717
You were sitting
I don't know

2451
