Next to Joaquin.
If he liked it.

2452
01:39:44.550 --> 01:39:45.426
Joaquin kind of was, like,

2453
01:39:45.426 --> 01:39:47.850
don't tell them I'm the Joker,

2454
01:39:47.850 --> 01:39:48.710
