2456
01:39:50.870 --> 01:39:51.985
the Joker's here.

2457
01:39:51.985 --> 01:39:53.810
He's amazing.
But yeah, the benefits

2458
01:39:53.810 --> 01:39:54.960
that come with it.

2459
